index 5a1e8c6..94d3f64 100644
--- a/packages/connector/README.md
+++ b/packages/connector/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,13 @@ The Node 24 LTS connector collects exact aggregate token counters from supported
 sources and pairs them with Vibe Racing agent accounts. It never uploads raw sessions or local
 paths.
 
+The connector's HTTP transport is shared by pairing, reconciliation, usage upload, doctor, and
+disconnect. It applies a 15-second request timeout and refuses redirects; response body and schema
+validation remain in the protocol layer. Only server failures (5xx), rate limiting (429), and
+transport failures are eligible for retry. Retries honor a bounded `Retry-After` value, then use
+capped exponential backoff with jitter; server-provided delays are capped at five minutes and
+backoff is capped at eight seconds before jitter.
+
 ```bash
 npx --yes --prefer-online --package https://viberacing.example/downloads/viberacing-connector.tgz -- \
   viberacing connect --origin https://viberacing.example
